"Share food": "分享食物",
"Heal yourself and every sister nearby.": "治疗自己和附近的所有姐妹。",
"Aphid herders: honeydew is worth 3 food instead of 2.": "蚜虫牧者：蜜露价值 3 份食物，而不是 2 份。",
"A worker that finds food lays a scent trail on the way home, and her sisters follow it. When two meet they tap antennae to share news, and sometimes food.": "找到食物的工蚁会在回家路上留下气味踪迹，姐妹们循迹而去。两只相遇时会碰碰触角交换消息，有时还会分享食物。",
"Cut leaf": "剪叶",
"Snip a leaf fragment from the plants around you.": "从身边的植物上剪下一片叶子。",
"Fungus farmers: carried leaves feed the fungus garden, which turns them into food.": "真菌农夫：搬回的叶子喂养真菌园，真菌再把它们变成食物。",
"Leafcutters do not eat the leaves they carry. They chew them into a mulch that feeds a fungus garden, and the fungus feeds the colony.": "切叶蚁并不吃它们搬运的叶子。它们把叶子嚼成碎屑喂养真菌园，再由真菌养活蚁群。",
"Venom burst": "毒液爆发",
"Sting every enemy around you. The venom keeps burning.": "蜇伤周围所有敌人，毒液会持续灼烧。",
"Cheap, venomous workers. You can paddle across water.": "廉价又有毒的工蚁。你能划水渡河。",
"Fire ants sting with a venom that burns. When floods come they link legs and float together as a living raft.": "火蚁的毒刺带来灼烧般的疼痛。洪水来临时，它们会腿挽着腿，组成一只活的筏子漂浮。",
"Jaw leap": "颚跃",
"Snap your jaws on the ground and fly forward, hitting anything in the way.": "用上颚猛击地面向前弹飞，撞击沿途的一切。",
"Spring-loaded jaws hit very hard.": "弹簧般的上颚打击力极强。",
"Its jaws lock open and snap shut in a fraction of a millisecond, one of the fastest movements in the animal world. It can even snap them against the ground to fling itself away.": "它的上颚张开锁定，能在不到一毫秒内合上，是动物界最快的动作之一。它甚至能用上颚撞击地面把自己弹开。",
"Bullet sting": "子弹蜇刺",
"A crushing sting that stuns your target.": "毁灭性的一蜇，能让目标眩晕。",
"Huge and tough, but each new sister costs a lot of food.": "又大又结实，但每位新姐妹都要花很多食物。",
"One of the largest ants in the world. Its sting is often rated the most painful of any insect.": "世界上最大的蚂蚁之一。它的蜇刺常被评为所有昆虫中最痛的。",
"Weave outpost": "编织前哨",
"Spend 15 food to build a leaf shelter where sisters drop food and heal (up to 3).": "花费 15 食物搭一个叶子庇护所，姐妹们可在此放下食物并恢复（最多 3 个）。",
"Fast and long-legged. Builds outposts far from home.": "长腿又敏捷。能在远离家的地方建前哨。",
"Weaver ants pull leaves together and glue them with silk spun by their own larvae, which workers hold in their jaws like living glue guns.": "黄猄蚁把叶子拉到一起，用自己幼虫吐的丝粘合，工蚁把幼虫衔在口中，就像活的胶枪。",
"Swarm raid": "蜂拥突袭",
"Every sister nearby surges at the closest prey and bites 30% harder for 8 seconds.": "附近所有姐妹扑向最近的猎物，8 秒内咬击力提高 30%。",
"Raiders: soldiers have huge hooked jaws, and sisters hunt in packs.": "掠夺者：兵蚁有巨大的钩状上颚，姐妹们成群狩猎。",
"Army ants are nearly blind and never build a nest. They camp in a living ball made of their own linked bodies, then pour out in raids of hundreds of thousands.": "行军蚁几乎失明，从不筑巢。它们用彼此相连的身体组成活的球体扎营，然后数十万只倾巢而出劫掠。",
"Honey lure": "蜜饵",
"Drop a sweet bead that draws nearby insects in for 12 seconds, right into your sisters’ jaws.": "放下一颗甜珠，在 12 秒内把附近的昆虫引过来，正好送进姐妹们的嘴里。",
"Living larders: the granary holds 80 more food, and honeydew is worth 3.": "活体粮仓：粮仓多存 80 食物，蜜露价值 3。",
"Some workers become living storage jars, called repletes. They hang from the nest ceiling with abdomens swollen with honey, feeding sisters in lean times.": "一些工蚁会变成活的储存罐，称为贮蜜蚁。它们挂在巢顶，腹部胀满蜂蜜，在困难时期喂养姐妹。",
"Gnaw through": "啃穿",
"For 6 seconds you chew straight through logs, stumps and stones.": "6 秒内你能直接啃穿原木、树桩和石头。",
"Big and strong. Does not eat wood, but tunnels through it.": "又大又壮。不吃木头，但会在里面挖隧道。",
"Carpenter ants carve galleries in damp, rotting wood. They do not eat it: the sawdust they push out piles up below the nest entrance.": "木匠蚁在潮湿腐烂的木头里凿出通道。它们并不吃木头：推出来的木屑堆在巢口下方。",
"Potent sting": "强力蜇刺",
"A sting with one of the strongest venoms of any insect: heavy poison on one target.": "拥有昆虫中最强毒液之一的蜇刺：对单个目标施加重毒。",
"Seed gatherers: seeds and sunflower seeds are worth double.": "采种者：种子和葵花籽价值翻倍。",
"Harvester ants clear a bare disc around their nest and store seeds in underground granaries. The bristly \"beard\" under the head carries sand and seeds.": "收获蚁在巢穴周围清出一片光秃的圆地，把种子储存在地下粮仓里。头部下方刚毛组成的\"胡子\"用来搬运沙子和种子。",
"Builds big domed mounds out of pine needles and defends them hard. Instead of stinging, it sprays formic acid.": "用松针筑起巨大的圆顶蚁丘并奋力守护。它不蜇人，而是喷射蚁酸。",
